{"strongs": "H6041", "word": "עָנִי", "translit": "a.ni", "root": "ענב", "morph": "H:A", "pos": "adj", "gloss": "poor, afflicted, humble", "definition": "עָנִי adj poor, afflicted, humble ; — ׳ ע Deut 24:12 + 51 t.; plural עֲיִּים Isa 3:15 + 6 t.; construct עֲנִיֵּי Isa 10:2 + 4 t. (see also Kt and Qr below עָנָו above); suffix עֲנִיֶּיךָ Ps 72:2 ; Ps 74:19 , עֲנִיֶּ֑ךָ Deut 15:11 , עֲנִיָּו Isa 49:13 feminine singular עֲנִיָּה Isa 51:21 ; Isa 54:11 ( + Isa 10:30 ᵑ0 , but read עֲנִיהָ , see I. ענה ); — 1. poor, needy , || אביון Deut 15:11 ; Deut 24:14 . 15 Prov 31:20 , || יתום Job 24:9 ; Exod 22:24 ( E ), Deut 24:12 having right to gleanings Lev 19:10 ; Lev 23:22 ( H ); ׳ יְמֵי ע Prov 15:15 , compare Prov 14:21 ( Kt ). 2. poor and weak , oppressed by the rich and powerful Isa 3:14 ; Isa 3:15 ; Isa 32:7 ( Qr ), Isa 58:7 ; Isa 29:12 ; Isa 36:6 ; Isa 36:15 ; Prov 30:14 ; Eccl 6:8 ; Ezek 18:17 ; Zech 7:10 ; Job 24:4 , also Amos 8:4 ( Qr ); || דל Job 34:28 ; Prov 22:22 עֲנִיֵּי עַמִּי Isa 10:2 עני ואביוך Job 24:14 ; Prov 31:9 ; Jer 22:16 ; Ezek 16:49 ; Ezek 18:12 ; Ezek 22:29 . 3. poor, weak, afflicted Israel, or pious in Israel afflicted by wicked nations or the wicked in Israel itself Ps 10:2 ; Ps 10:9 (twice in verse); Ps 14:6 (dubious, compare Ps 53:6 ) Ps 102:1 (or proper name), Isa 14:32 ; Hab 3:14 of Zion, עֲנִיָּה Isa 51:21 ; Isa 54:11 ׳ שׁד ע Ps 12:6 ׳ יחיד וע Ps 25:16 עני ואביון Ps 35:10 ; Ps 37:14 ; Ps 40:18 = Ps 70:6 ; Ps 74:21 ; Ps 86:1 ; Ps 109:16 ; Ps 109:22 , plural Isa 41:17 עני וְכוֺאֵב Ps 69:30 וָרָשׁ ׳ ע Ps 82:3 ׳ עֱנוּת ע Ps 22:25 וְגֹוֵעַ ׳ ע Ps 88:16 || דל Isa 26:6 ; Zeph 3:12 וּנְכֵהרֿוּחַ ׳ ע Isa 66:2 — Zech 11:7 ; Zech 11:11 see II. כְּנַעֲנִי ; — God does not forget them Ps 9:13 ( Kt ); Ps 9:19 ( Qr ); Ps 10:12 ( Kt ) Ps 74:19 , but has compassion on them Isa 49:13 , saves Ps 34:7 , delivers Ps 35:10 , and bestows various favours Ps 68:11 ; Ps 140:13 , the king also judges Ps 72:2 ; Ps 72:4 , and delivers Ps 72:12 . 4. humble, lowly , Zech 9:9 (victorious king); opposed to לֵצִים Prov 3:34 ( Kt ); opposed to גֵּאִים Prov 16:19 ( Kt ); עם עני opposed to רמות עינים Ps 18:28 = 2Sam 22:28 .", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6213')\">BDB6213</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H6041')\">H6041</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6212')\">BDB6212</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB6214')\">BDB6214</entry></div><p> <bdbheb>עָנִי</bdbheb> <b>adj</b> <highlightword>poor, afflicted, humble</highlightword>; — <bdbheb>׳</bdbheb><bdbheb>ע</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 24:12\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"24\" vBegin=\"12\" cEnd=\"24\" vEnd=\"12\" onclick=\"bcv(5,24,12)\">Deut 24:12</ref> + 51 t.; plural <bdbheb>עֲיִּים</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 3:15\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"3\" vBegin=\"15\" cEnd=\"3\" vEnd=\"15\" onclick=\"bcv(23,3,15)\">Isa 3:15</ref> + 6 t.; construct <bdbheb>עֲנִיֵּי</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 10:2\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"10\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"10\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(23,10,2)\">Isa 10:2</ref> + 4 t. (see also <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Kt')\"><reflink>Kt</reflink></lookup> and <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('Qr')\"><reflink>Qr</reflink></lookup> below <bdbheb>עָנָו</bdbheb> above); suffix <bdbheb>עֲנִיֶּיךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Ps 72:2\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"72\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"72\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(19,72,2)\">Ps 72:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Ps 74:19\" b=\"19\" cBegin=\"74\" vBegin=\"19\" cEnd=\"74\" vEnd=\"19\" onclick=\"bcv(19,74,19)\">Ps 74:19</ref>, <bdbheb>עֲנִיֶּ֑ךָ</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Deut 15:11\" b=\"5\" cBegin=\"15\" vBegin=\"11\" cEnd=\"15\" vEnd=\"11\" onclick=\"bcv(5,15,11)\">Deut 15:11</ref>, <bdbheb>עֲנִיָּו</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 49:13\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"49\" vBegin=\"13\" cEnd=\"49\" vEnd=\"13\" onclick=\"bcv(23,49,13)\">Isa 49:13</ref> feminine singular <bdbheb>עֲנִיָּה</bdbheb> <ref ref=\"Isa 51:21\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\"51\" vBegin=\"21\" cEnd=\"51\" vEnd=\"21\" onclick=\"bcv(23,51,21)\">Isa 51:21</ref>; <ref ref=\"Isa 54:11\" b=\"23\" cBegin=\